格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"dsh plugin: DeepSeek Harness 的模型层 = raincode(模型池/缓存/重试) + /skills 浏览","id":"gh:1333256775","install_available":false,"language":"Rust","name":"dsh-plugins-raincode","slug":"rainforest888/dsh-plugins-raincode","topics":["agent-harness","ai-agent","coding-agent","cost-optimization","deepseek","deepseek-harness","dsh-plugin","llm","llm-gateway","model-pool","model-routing","multi-model","openai-compatible","plugin","prompt-caching","raincode","rust","typescript"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"dsh plugin: DeepSeek Harness 的模型层 = raincode(模型池/缓存/重试) + /skills 浏览"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-raincode"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"Make **raincode** the model layer of **DeepSeek Harness (dsh)**: a cheap model\npool with StablePrefi"},{"id":"p3s2","text":"x prompt caching, retries and failover, driven by a local\nOpenAI-compatible gateway and shipped as d"},{"id":"p3s3","text":"ching, retries and failover, driven by a local\nOpenAI-compatible gateway and shipped as dsh plugins."},{"id":"p4s1","text":"One repository, two halves:"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"| Half | Language | Role |"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"| `packages/` | TypeScript | dsh plugins — translate dsh's `GenerateOptions` into the OpenAI wire fo"},{"id":"p6s2","text":"rmat, stream chunks back, auto-spawn the gateway |\n| `crates/` | Rust | the raincode gateway — model"},{"id":"p6s3","text":" pool, prompt caching, retries/failover, skill network, capability refresh |"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"The plugins are the \"mouth\"; the gateway is the \"brain\". The plugins hold no\nmodel logic."},{"id":"p8s1","text":"## What it does"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"- Transparent takeover (best effort): dsh chat requests whose model is in the pool\nare served by the"},{"id":"p9s2","text":" raincode adapter; a matching profile is derived from dsh's\ncurrent model when dsh exposes one, othe"},{"id":"p9s3","text":"rwise set `mainModel` or a `role: main`\nprofile.\n- Model pool configured through dsh plugin settings"},{"id":"p9s4","text":" (profiles with\n`role: main | subagent | any` and direction `tags`).\n- Capability refresh from OpenR"},{"id":"p9s5","text":"outer, DeepSWE and opencode usage leaderboards\n(top 15 refreshed weekly; any other model refreshed o"},{"id":"p9s6","text":"n demand).\n- Prompt caching, retries and provider failover (`rc-pro`).\n- Skill network: skills are i"},{"id":"p9s7","text":"ndexed as an empty-body DAG that drills down to\nshort leaf checklists; `raincode_learn` distills ses"},{"id":"p9s8","text":"sions into review-gated\nskills.\n- Request logging and status (`/requests`, `raincode_status`)."},{"id":"p10s1","text":"## Packages"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"| Package | Focus | Tools / Commands |"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"| `dsh-plugins-raincode-skill` | Skill self-evolution network — browse / search / load raincode skil"},{"id":"p12s2","text":"ls and distill experience into `SKILL.md` | `/skills`, `raincode_skill_search`, `raincode_skill_load"},{"id":"p12s3","text":"`, `raincode_learn`, `raincode_status` |\n| `dsh-plugins-raincode-routing` | Model auto-routing — a s"},{"id":"p12s4","text":"trong main model decomposes a large task and dispatches cheaper subagents by direction | `raincode_r"},{"id":"p12s5","text":"oute`, `raincode_agent_tree`, `raincode_refresh_model`, `raincode_status` |\n| `@raincode-dsh/core` |"},{"id":"p12s6","text":" Shared adapter core (OpenAI wire serialization, SSE translation, gateway auto-spawn); published so "},{"id":"p12s7","text":"the two plugins can resolve it independently | — |"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"## Gateway crates"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"| Crate | Role |"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"| `rc-pro` | OpenAI / Anthropic / compatible providers, cache keys, retries |\n| `rc-profile` | model"},{"id":"p15s2","text":"-pool registry and key management |\n| `rc-gateway` | headless HTTP gateway |\n| `rc-capability` | mul"},{"id":"p15s3","text":"ti-source model capability refresh and scoring |\n| `rc-skill` | `SKILL.md` store, DAG network, route"},{"id":"p15s4","text":"r and navigator |\n| `rc-state` | SQLite persistence for skills / navigation / model profiles |\n| `rc"},{"id":"p15s5","text":"-cli` | `raincode proxy` + non-interactive profile / skill commands |"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"## Layout"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"## Quick start"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"Prerequisites: Rust `>= 1.75` for the gateway; dsh `>= 0.2.2-rc.1` and Node.js\n`>= 22.19` to build/r"},{"id":"p19s2","text":"Rust `>= 1.75` for the gateway; dsh `>= 0.2.2-rc.1` and Node.js\n`>= 22.19` to build/run the plugins."},{"id":"p20s1","text":"1. Install the raincode CLI (`>= 0.1.0`):\n`cargo install --path crates/rc-cli` (or `./install.sh` / "},{"id":"p20s2","text":"`install.ps1`).\n2. Configure your model pool: `raincode setup` (writes `~/.raincode/profiles.toml`)."},{"id":"p20s3","text":"\n3. Start the gateway: `raincode proxy --port 8787`, then verify\n`curl http://127.0.0.1:8787/health`"},{"id":"p20s4","text":" → `{\"ok\":true,\"service\":\"raincode-gateway\"}`."},{"id":"p21s1","text":"## Install in dsh"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"Requires dsh `>= 0.2.2-rc.1` — see `docs/COMPATIBILITY.md`\nfor the API surface, the 0.2.2 changes an"},{"id":"p22s2","text":"d the verification notes."},{"id":"p23s1","text":"In a development checkout, link both plugin packages into a profile (this is the\nsetup the 0.2.2 por"},{"id":"p23s2","text":"t was validated with):"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"Each package ships a `cordis.patch.yml` and declares it under `dsh.bundle.patch`, so\nadding the pack"},{"id":"p25s2","text":"age to `dsh.profile.bundles` inserts its loader row automatically:"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"Check the wiring without starting the app:"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"Settings show up under those two ids in dsh's settings UI. They are volatile:\nedits apply to the nex"},{"id":"p29s2","text":"t request, no restart. The gateway starts on demand when\n`spawnGateway` is on; the binary is looked "},{"id":"p29s3","text":"up as `gatewayBin` setting →\n`RAINCODE_BIN` → repo `target/release/raincode` → `~/.raincode/bin` → `"},{"id":"p29s4","text":"PATH`, so\n`cargo build --release` in this repo is enough."},{"id":"p30s1","text":"## Development"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"Build the release binary with `npm run backend:build` (or `cargo build --release`)."},{"id":"p33s1","text":"## Docs and history"},{"id":"p34s1","text":"- `docs/superpowers/specs/` — design documents for the gateway and the plugins.\n- `docs/superpowers/"},{"id":"p34s2","text":"plans/` — implementation plans (including the capability-score\nenrichment plan behind `tools/enrich_"},{"id":"p34s3","text":"models.py`).\n- `docs/COMPATIBILITY.md` — dsh 0.2.2 API surface, what\nchanged, and how this repo adap"},{"id":"p34s4","text":"ts.\n- `docs/COMPETITORS.md` — similar dsh plugins and where\nraincode differs.\n- `handoff/` — handoff"},{"id":"p34s5","text":" notes and a post-mortem of the earlier multi-agent\nrefactor attempt.\n- `skills/` — the default skil"},{"id":"p34s6","text":"l playbooks; `agents/` — role prompts for dsh\nsubagents."},{"id":"p35s1","text":"## License"},{"id":"p36s1","text":"MIT"}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
